{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id780958143"}, "name":{"label":"AniBonnie15"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-03-16T09:40:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.17"}, "id":{"label":"5669104671"}, "title":{"label":"Kinda sounds like you want to replace real musical artists"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a cool app, but don’t kid yourself and act like music can be reduced to a bunch of generated sounds and can replace musical artists. It shouldn’t. Music is about so much more, humble yourself! \n\nYou have removed all MEANING from music and destroyed the community that comes with it. You’re one step away from destroying the inspiration of art and music by reducing it to emotionless algorithms. \n\nSo yeah, let’s NOT create a future where reality is simulated! And don’t be complicit in creating one.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1154429580&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
