{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id260023583"}, "name":{"label":"6speedhaven"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-02-11T20:14:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.17"}, "id":{"label":"5519564734"}, "title":{"label":"Data hungry, no \"feel\" app responds to like or dislike input"}, "content":{"label":"In a bit over 1 hour of listening, the app consumed nearly 200 megabytes of my mobile data. When I dislike something I feel like the app should try to pinpoint faster what I'm trying to dislike. I disliked 200 times a part of a song where there were cymbal sounds anytime they appeared. I never saw the track try to change itself...should it take more than 5-10 minutes to keep hearing them before I tire and change the track manually? Everything else sounded great but those cymbals on the track. Quite a shame.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1154429580&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
