{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id134510742"}, "name":{"label":"Szei"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-11-13T10:06:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.14"}, "id":{"label":"5133037192"}, "title":{"label":"Really like this but lots of room to improve."}, "content":{"label":"I can’t figure out what the upside down heart means. Is it like a “thumbs down” to contrast with the heart symbol being a “thumbs up”?\n\nAlso, does giving likes work independently for each station? Like giving a heart in the relax station just impacts the way the relax station learns? Or does it also influence other stations (which it probably shouldn’t).\n\nIt would also be good to be able to train different versions of the same station. I might not always want to listen to the same style of techno for instance.\n\nFinally, the app needs volume controls. It is too quiet when my headphones (BeatsX) are on the lowest setting, but if I increase the volume by one from the lowest it jumps from being too quiet to being too loud.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1154429580&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
